2.	DESCRIPTION OF EXPIRIENCE/TOPIC - (Safa Basil)
My work focused on preparing the Telco Customer Churn dataset for future machine learning classification. I first divided the original 7,043 records into 70% training data and 30% testing data using a stratified split. 
All exploratory analysis and preprocessing decisions were based on the training data. I corrected blank values in TotalCharges, created the TotalServices feature, encoded categorical columns, and normalized and scaled numerical 
columns. I also balanced the training target through random oversampling. Finally, I transformed the untouched testing data without refitting the preprocessing tools and exported separate processed training and testing datasets.

